WEBVTT

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.150
It was only a small hope.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.490
For our days to begin anew.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.490
We decided to fight and never give up.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:21.290
We vowed to become stronger
than we were yesterday.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.080
To stand up to our destiny,
which had been set in motion...

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.510
So that those precious to us
are never hurt again...

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.680
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.760
Sorry. Did I wake you up?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.140
No...

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:17.060
You should really sleep in your bed.
You'll catch a cold like that.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.320
S-Sorry.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.240
Signum, did you stay up
late again last night?

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.660
Ah... well... a little.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.880
Signum. Here you go.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.920
It's hot milk.
It'll warm you right up.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.430
Thank you... very much.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.890
I have some for you too, Zafira.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.010
Come here.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.850
I'm so sorry! I overslept!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.110
Good morning, Shamal.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.110
Good morning!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:02.030
Ah, geez...
I'm really sorry, Hayate-chan!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:02.780
It's fine.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.860
Mornin'...

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.160
You look wiped out.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.660
I am...

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.660
Really. Go wash your face.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.670
After I've had my milk.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.080
Here you are.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.590
<i>This is... warm.</i>

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:33.810
Now then, everyone, this was just
decided on very short notice,

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:37.600
but starting today, a new friend will be joining our class.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.360
She's from overseas,
studying abroad.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.280
Fate-san, please come in.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.240
Excuse me...

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.240
She's so cute!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:58.370
Um... my name is Fate Testarossa.
It's a pleasure to meet everyone.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.260
New Powers, Activate!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.660
Hey, what are schools like
where you come from?

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.990
Umm, I didn't exactly...

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.540
This transfer came out of nowhere. Why?

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.910
Umm... a lot happened, and...

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:31.460
You're really good at Japanese.
Where did you learn it?

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.410
What was it like where
you used to live?

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.660
Umm... uh... well...

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.180
Fate-chan's... really popular.

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:41.920
But this might be a little too much...

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.670
Guess I have no choice...

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.300
Alright, alright!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:52.350
Let's not turn the new student
into a spectacle on her first day.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:54.850
Arisa!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.490
Also, let's ask these questions
in an orderly fashion.

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:59.360
You're bothering Fate like this.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.450
Okay! Then let's start with my question!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:02.860
Yes, go ahead.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.040
What are the schools like
where you come from?

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:11.870
U-Umm... I didn't go to a normal school.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:15.920
I learned everything from someone
who was kind of like a tutor...

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.870
Is that so?

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.720
Yeah, yeah! Me next!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:22.120
Hold on a second! Wait!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.840
Chrono-kun, how's the
setup coming along?

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.770
We've finished moving the
equipment and materials in.

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:33.090
Now we're working on setting
up the peripheral probe network.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:33.900
I see.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:37.230
Admiral Graham put in
some good words for you,

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:41.820
so your request to command some of the
Bureau's armed troops has been granted.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.310
Thank you very much, Admiral Leti.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:49.940
And Admiral Graham's
familiars also miss you.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.070
They said they wanted to
see their cute student again.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.080
The Liese twins, huh...?

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:57.870
Umm... would you mind
playing with them for me?

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.640
Oh, Chrono-kun.
How's everything on your end?

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:09.560
They're letting me borrow some
of the Bureau's armed troops.

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.600
I'll have them help out in the search.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.630
How about you?

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.810
Not too good...

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.850
More were attacked last night.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.990
Dozens of mages and
about four wild animals.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:26.030
They were all attacked the same way
on some worlds farther away from here.

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.110
Wild animals?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.980
Large creatures with strong magical power.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.710
Apparently it just has to have a
Linker Core, it doesn't need to be human.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.840
They're really attacking
anything and everything.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:42.500
And I looked at the data on the
Book of Darkness... but what exactly is it?

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.890
A Lost Logia that stores magical power.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:51.510
It devours Linker Cores, the source
of magical power, and fills its pages.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:55.100
Once all 666 pages are filled,

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:59.110
it will release all of that magical power,
and unleash its true potential.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:01.890
Power great enough to create
a dimensional disturbance.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:08.240
And in the case that either it
or its owner is destroyed,

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:12.150
apparently its pages turn blank again
and it'll recreate itself on another world.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:18.330
It crosses many worlds, is protected
by the guardians that it spawns,

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.740
devours magical power, and lives eternally.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.670
Even if we destroy it,
it'll just recreate itself over and over.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:27.800
It's an incredibly dangerous
magical tome that cannot be stopped.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.630
That's the Book of Darkness?

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:34.220
All we can do is capture it before it's completed?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:39.970
Right. We'll first have to capture its
guardians and drag out its master.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:41.970
Yeah!

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:53.150
Fate-chan, what did you think
of your first day of school?

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:59.530
I've never been near so many people my
own age, so it's a little overwhelming.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.420
You'll get used to it in no time, I'm sure.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.750
Yeah. That'd be great.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.920
Well, I'll leave you to take Hayate-chan
to the hospital. Okay, Signum?

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.420
Got it. Have Vita and
Zafira left already?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.050
They have.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.680
Cartridges, huh?

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:25.180
Yeah. I have to make a
new batch by tonight.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.400
Sorry for making you do all this.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:31.690
I'm the support for our team,
so don't worry about it.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:37.780
Stand.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:38.990
Bow.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.580
Goodbye!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.370
Yup, goodbye!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.370
Bye!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.460
The search is going well so far.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:56.550
You and Fate should try to live normal
lives when you're not training.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.600
Nanoha, your magical power
hasn't fully returned yet...

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.860
and Raising Heart and Bardiche
are still being repaired.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:05.060
If there's a crisis, you should
try to get to safety.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.640
One more thing... it looks like the two
staves should be ready next week.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.490
And finally...

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:17.900
can you tell Fate it's fine to make stops on the
way home, as long as she's back for dinner?

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.540
As I thought... there haven't
been many positive effects.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.970
But then again, there haven't been any bad side effects, either...

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.130
so why don't we continue with this
treatment a little longer?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:44.140
Okay. Umm... I'll leave it to you.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.350
You'll leave it to me?

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:51.020
This is about you, so why don't you
think about it more on your own?

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.810
Umm...

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.780
I trust you, Doctor, so...

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.800
How's Hayate-chan's daily life?

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.670
She's perfectly healthy,
besides the paralysis in her legs.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:22.600
I thought so... I know it must be difficult for
you, too, but we're doing the best we can.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.260
I understand.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.640
We're moving treatment
towards easing the paralysis...

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.100
How are you doing?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.680
I'm doing great.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.280
It's possible that from now on,

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:38.940
she'll have to undergo more serious
treatment, requiring further hospitalization.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:43.070
I see... I'll discuss it with her.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.220
Thanks for having us!

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.810
Well, see you two tomorrow.

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.220
Yeah, see you tomorrow.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.300
Bye bye!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:11.480
Hey, Nanoha... what do
you think of those people?

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:14.180
By "those people," you mean the ones with the Book of Darkness?

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:17.690
Yeah. I'm talking about
its guardian knights...

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:23.410
Umm... they attacked me so suddenly,
and I was taken down pretty quickly,

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.750
so I'm not too sure...

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:29.200
But you talked to that
female swordsman, right?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.760
Yeah. She had this
mysterious feel about her.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:37.210
I can't really explain it, but I didn't
sense any evil intentions from her.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:41.140
I see... I'm sure they have reasons for
having to complete the Book of Darkness,

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:43.680
but I just wish they'd tell me.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:47.230
It wasn't a situation where we
could just talk about it, though...

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:49.940
When you harden your heart
with strong intentions,

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:53.110
words from others just don't reach you.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.020
I was the same way,
so I can understand...

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.650
I did everything for my mother, but...

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.860
no matter how much I was hurt...

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.690
no matter how wrong I
thought it might be...

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.110
no matter how much I doubted her...

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:11.450
I believed that she couldn't be wrong.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:16.870
When I believed that,
nobody's words could reach me.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:26.420
But speaking to someone and
expressing your feelings isn't useless.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:30.400
After all, your words shook me so much,
even though I was certain

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:34.640
that I was just doing it for my mother... or for myself.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:42.910
If we need to fight and beat
them to get our words across...

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:46.500
I feel like I'll be able to fight without hesitation.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:47.780
Fate-chan...

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:52.280
You were the one who taught me that,
Nanoha... to have a strong heart.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.290
I... I wouldn't say that...

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:06.310
So... I'll become stronger.
So our words will reach them.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:10.190
Yeah. I'll also become stronger.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.690
Let's do our best together, Fate-chan!

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.720
Yeah. Let's do our best, Nanoha.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:33.620
Hayate-chan!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.620
Suzuka-chan!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:41.210
Suzuka-chan, what did you
borrow from the library today?

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:44.390
A fairy tale book.

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:47.130
It looks like this one has stories
that really touch the heart.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.730
I love fairy tales, too.
That one sounds pretty interesting.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:53.760
Do you want to read it? There were some
more copies of the first volume.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.640
Yeah. I'll take a look later.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.890
So you also like fairy tales!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:02.200
I love them! What kind of
stories are in that one?

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:03.900
You'll have to read it to find out!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.760
Book of Darkness, begin collection.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.010
Collecting.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.070
Three more pages with this one, huh?

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:54.750
Damn it... even though they're so big,
their Linker Cores are nothing.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:58.530
Well, at least this is easier than fighting
other mages, and it <i>is</i> pretty efficient.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.200
Let's move on to the next one, Zafira.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.830
Vita, are you sure you shouldn't rest first?

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.800
I'm fine, I'm a knight.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.380
I'm not so weak that something
like <i>this</i> would tire me out.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:20.620
Thank you very much.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.510
Nanoha!

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.160
How did your exam go?

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.170
Complete recovery!

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.290
Complete recovery here, too.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.300
Is that so? Thank goodness!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.480
Where are you right now?

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.730
At the second relay port.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:42.150
We'll be back in about ten minutes.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:47.100
I see. Then I'll explain Raising Heart and
Bardiche's changes once you retur–

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.440
This is bad!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.440
Emergency situation at close range!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:59.370
We've captured two targets
in the sky above the urban district.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.000
We are currently working to
suppress them within a barrier.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.420
Your opponents are powerful.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.630
Avoid hostilities and focus
on strengthening the barrier.

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:07.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.660
I'll send our head Enforcer there right away!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.940
The Administrative Bureau, huh?

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:23.050
These guys are fodder.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.810
Let's hit back!

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.310
Above us!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.850
Stinger Blade Execution Shift!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:36.530
Fire!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.080
Looks like... some got through...

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.670
Zafira!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.170
Don't worry about it.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:59.670
I'm not so weak as to let <i>this</i> faze me!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.050
Bring it on!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:08.570
Armed Bureau members are in position!
Okay, Chrono-kun!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:09.220
Roger!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:12.230
Also, I just teleported some
backup to your location!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.860
Nanoha! Fate!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.370
They're...!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.920
Raising Heart!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:34.920
Bardiche!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.170
Set up!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.060
Order of "Set up" was accepted.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.770
Operating check with the
new system has started.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:51.350
Exchanged parts are in green condition.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:51.890
Completely cleared from the
neuro-dyna-ident Alpha-01 to Beta-865.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.890
Th-This is...

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.450
...different from before...!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.780
Both of you, calm down and
listen to me for a second.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:58.400
Deformation mechanism:
confirmation is in good condition.
Both of you, calm down and
listen to me for a second.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:02.290
Raising Heart and Bardiche have
had a new system installed.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:03.080
Main system, start up.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.390
A new system...?

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:05.240
Haken Form deformation preparation.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.390
Both of them wished for it with
their own wills and feelings.

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:10.600
The battle with the maximum
performance is always possible.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:14.730
An Accel and a Buster,
the mode switching became possible.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:14.790
The percentage synchronicity of 90 is maintained.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:19.750
Call out their new names.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.970
Condition: All Green. Get set.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:24.260
Stand by, Ready.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.510
Raising Heart Excelion!

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.310
Bardiche Assault!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.560
Drive Ignition.

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:22.330
Their devices... did they really...?!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.550
Assault Form. Cartridge set.

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:32.550
Accel Mode. Stand by, Ready.

00:25:08.400 --> 00:25:11.650
Raising Heart and Bardiche
have had huge power ups!

00:25:11.650 --> 00:25:14.360
Now I can really go
full power at full throttle!

00:25:14.360 --> 00:25:20.200
And within the storm of battle,
the truth of those girls comes out...

00:25:20.200 --> 00:25:23.040
A quiet past, and a sad destiny.

00:25:23.880 --> 00:25:26.970
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:26.970 --> 00:25:27.670
Episode 5:

00:25:28.080 --> 00:25:29.960
It Was a Small Wish (Part I).

00:25:29.960 --> 00:25:31.460
So let's start Part I with a...

00:25:31.460 --> 00:25:33.300
Drive Ignition!
